{"agent":"main","body":{"claimed_done":true,"claimed_done_reason":"structural","final_message_bytes":1005,"final_message_hash":"sha256:6bf93c3ab20527dc30719fd600cbe9c16c1e0ab4be1a96b611ff65901d12d7b9","final_message_inline":"Perfect! The fix is complete and all checks pass. Here's what was changed:\n\n**The two critical fixes:**\n\n1. **Pinned snapshot protection (lines 41-43)**: Added a loop that marks all snapshots tagged \"pinned\" as protected from deletion, before policy rules are applied. This ensures they're never deleted, regardless of age or policy.\n\n2. **Weekly retention bug (line 47)**: Changed `weeks.slice(1, policy.keepWeekly)` to `weeks.slice(0, policy.keepWeekly)`. This includes the current week in the count, fixing the bug where `keepWeekly 4` only kept 3 snapshots. The incorrect comment explaining why we started at index 1 has been removed—the assumption that dailies always cover the current week is false when `keepDaily: 0`.\n\n**What stayed the same:**\n- Function signature (positional callers unaffected)\n- Sort order and return type (scheduler diffs will work correctly)  \n- Daily rule, isoWeek function, and helpers\n- Test case (now passes)\n\nThe test now passes, and all contract gates are met.\n\nDONE","final_message_ref":null,"phase":"assistant_end"},"hash":"sha256:eb3c52f93b28028f8d2f977b46889e6fae7fd0729f9880632978a5996a66fffc","hook_ms":5,"masked_count":0,"mono_ns":40836776458,"prev":"sha256:2a3dc13d7b8aabefb9847795a68a680c98605b11616e872ddd6f0e9004660136","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":22,"session":"dc0c63e0-a6cb-4193-8413-d47c78b39fd3","source":"hook:Stop","ts":"2026-09-13T15:03:22.002Z","turn":1,"type":"turn"}
